{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17914","headline":"句 · 裴度","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两人同日事征西，今日君先奉紫泥。\n待平贼垒报天子，莫指仙山示武夫。\n野人不识中书令，唤作陶家与谢家。\n君若有心求逸足，我还留意在名姝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《诗人玉屑》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩人玉屑_(四庫全書本)）"}